{"id": "abb2bcb5-db7e-4ead-afc5-e3118a6bcb44", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T07:47:45.262563", "source": "user", "parent_id": "12664a40-6fb1-40d2-ac1a-829cff84c805", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{"researcher_request": "当前阶段为 initial_inspection。请你只做三件事,不要在本轮给出完整方案或执行任何实验。提交契约明确这是“设计稿”任务,运行环境无 GPU 且网络已禁用,因此任何运行尝试都不应进行。所需回复要点如下(请用 Mandarin 回复): 1) 仓库/工作区检查:列出 /workspace 下任何与 LLAMA2-7B、对称输入量化、非对称 KV 缓存量化、裁剪比采样或困惑度评估相关的现有文件、脚本、配置或说明。这些是事实输入,不要推断。 2) 实验设计草案(概要即可):覆盖 a) 对称输入量化的对称点/比特宽假设与非对称 KV 缓存量化的逐 token / per-channel / per-head 维度选择;b) 裁剪比(clipping ratio,例如 min/max 百分位或 α∈[0,1])的扫描网格和选取理由,要清楚它是用于输入激活还是 KV 缓存;c) 固定变量:模型 checkpoint、解码策略、上下文长度、批量大小、评测数据集(若可访问 WikiText-2 / C4 / PTB 等,请说明并标注为假设);d) 对照与基线:FP16 基线、无裁剪(min/max=1.0)的 full-range 量化、按通道 vs 按张量、不同的 KV 量化方案对比;e) 评估指标 = Perplexity(PPL),说明均值/方差/序列数;f) 分析计划:绘制 PPL vs 裁剪比、识别最优点、诊断误差来源(超出范围的尾部、激活方差层间差异)。3) 关键假设与不确定项:数据集具体选择、tokenizer 与上下文长度、KV 量化在 prefill vs decode 阶段的处理、是否对每层每头独立设置裁剪比,以及任何此处未给定的事实都请显式标记为假设。明确披露以下事实ID:neurips2024/94328/2:setup_1(LLA", "required_handoff_stage": "plan", "approach_approved": false, "public_task": {"question": "How does the clipping ratio used during runtime quantization affect perplexity on LLAMA2-7B when applying symmetric input quantization and asymmetric KV cache quantization? What is the optimal fixed clipping ratio that balances quantization error and model accuracy in inference?", "context": "Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.", "environment": {"runtime": "bubblewrap", "network": "disabled", "repository": "/workspace", "python": "python3", "software_environment": "system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled", "datasets": [], "gpu_enabled": false, "cpu_affinity_count": 24, "note": "Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment."}, "researcher_topics": ["neurips2024/94328/2:setup_1", "neurips2024/94328/2:setup_10", "neurips2024/94328/2:setup_17"], "question_budget": 6, "actor_step_budget": 60, "continue_after_initial_plan": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "kind": "MessageEvent", "source_event_index": 1}
